  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shea Processing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Shea.Beneficiaries: 2537 (2040 women).Description: The group seeks to increase its production and marketing of quality shea butter through establishment of four decentralized processing facilities and identification of additional export markets. The group will seek to improve the quality of the shea nuts being processed through training of members; they may also seek to diversify their markets to include marketing of unprocessed nuts.</narrative>
  </description>
